SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Skip entirely. Replace with 20–30 min f
 lat walk or full rest
DESCRIPTION:Skip entirely. Replace with 20–30 min flat walk or full rest.
  No cycling until at least one clear day of body battery ≥55 and normal 
 resting HR is confirmed post-illness.\n\nReason: Athlete self-reported sti
 ll sick on 15 Aug\; wellness data shows body battery of only 58 max and se
 verely broken sleep (401 min last night) — returning to even a reduced r
 ide on the first day back from illness is premature and risks prolonging r
 ecovery.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
