SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with an easy 20–25 min walk/jog
  test at fully conver
DESCRIPTION:Replace with an easy 20–25 min walk/jog test at fully convers
 ational effort (HR ≤135 bpm)\; if HR stays controlled and no symptoms ap
 pear\, add a 20-min gentle pool swim (technique only\, no pace targets). S
 top immediately if any breathlessness or elevated HR.\n\nReason: Athlete i
 s only one day into the return from multi-week illness\; a 54-min run on d
 ay two back is too large a jump — a short movement test gives the same r
 eturn-to-training signal at a fraction of the physiological cost.\n\nAI co
 aching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
