SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with a continuous 25–30 min eas
 y jog at 6:30–7:00/km
DESCRIPTION:Replace with a continuous 25–30 min easy jog at 6:30–7:00/k
 m (HR ≤140 bpm) — no intervals. Intervals require a fitness base that 
 has effectively been zeroed by 3.5 weeks of illness\; Zone 2 continuity is
  the only appropriate stimulus this week.\n\nReason: Post-illness detraini
 ng means lactate threshold capacity will be significantly reduced\; introd
 ucing 5:45/km intervals in week one back risks injury and excessive fatigu
 e before the Half Oceanman build has even begun.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
