SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Cap at 60 min indoors or on a flat route 
 at 110–130W (well b
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 60 min indoors or on a flat route at 110–130W (well be
 low Z2 ceiling)\; target HR 125–138 bpm throughout. Ignore the 95km dist
 ance marker — at this recovery stage duration and HR control matter\, no
 t distance.\n\nReason: 95km implies ~3+ hours at normal pace which is far 
 beyond appropriate loading one week post-illness\; a controlled 60-min aer
 obic spin at reduced power is sufficient to restart cycling fitness withou
 t accumulating excessive fatigue ahead of the Half Oceanman build.\n\nAI c
 oaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
