SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with 35 min easy continuous run a
 t 6:15–6:30/km (HR 
DESCRIPTION:Replace with 35 min easy continuous run at 6:15–6:30/km (HR 
 ≤142 bpm). If this goes well with no cardiac drift\, a single 1km effort
  at 5:50/km can be added at the end as a controlled stimulus — but only 
 one\, not five.\n\nReason: With the Treviso 10K 57 days away and the athle
 te coming off prolonged illness\, introducing a full interval session in w
 eek two of return (and while abroad) risks injury and poor quality\; one e
 asy run with an optional single effort builds pace confidence without over
 cooking a fragile system.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
END:VEVENT
