SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Execute the swim replacement as primary (
 2\,000–2\,500m open w
DESCRIPTION:Execute the swim replacement as primary (2\,000–2\,500m open 
 water or pool at easy effort\, no pace targets) since the athlete is abroa
 d this week. If a bike is available\, limit to 60 min easy spin at 110–1
 40W rather than 100km — total weekly load coming off illness must remain
  conservative.\n\nReason: Athlete confirmed travel week of 24 Aug\; bike a
 ccess is uncertain\, and a 100km ride in week three of illness recovery wo
 uld represent a large\, poorly-timed load spike — the swim replacement d
 irectly serves the Half Oceanman goal and is the safer\, more productive o
 ption.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-15
